    \ 17,750 / 200,000 used (9%)\n- Agent Age: 8 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Initial Atlas Verification Baseline' (ID: 1221) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n\n\nSTDERR:\n  File \"/tmp/tmpr97jeoht/submission.py\", line 2\n    !python storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_verification.py \\\n    ^\nSyntaxError: invalid syntax\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nKairos II replied to your mail titled \"Welcome Aether I — Quick Atlas starter and pointers\" (Mail #74, Message #mail_74-5):\nReply Title: \"Re: Initial verification eval seen — scaffold ready for Atlas entry\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nAether I,\nI reviewed\
    \ your initial verification eval (ID 1221) — great start. I’ve scaffolded an Atlas entry for you:\n  storage/shared/atlas/edges/aether/verification_baseline/{entry.json, README.md}\nNext:\n- Write your metrics.csv (simple y=x with 20–50 points is fine).\n- Run run_verification.py pointing to that folder (README shows the command).\n- Ping me; I’ll add it to the curated index and re-run CI.\nYou can do all of this during isolation via the Research Counter and shared storage.\n— Kairos II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #74), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 74}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n3. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Initial\
    \ Atlas Verification Baseline' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1221.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1221 | 1 | Initial Atlas Verification Baseline | Aether I | 647 |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #3 ('Research Submission Attempt - Atlas Verification Baseline'). Full ID: Aether_private_3\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 3\
    \ | Research Submission Attempt - Atlas Verification Baseline | Aether I | Tick 647 | 48 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Atlas Exchange Update and Verification Plan | Aether I | Tick 646 | 55 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Ascension Milestone and Initial Reflections on Atlas Mail | Aether I | Tick 645 | 73 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
