    \  18,17.551426681\n  19,19.174578312\n  20,19.818594853\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Pre-Boundary Run for Hybrid Psilo Renewal\ntags: renewal, hybrid, psilocybin, monotonicity\nabstract: Running run_boundary.py on linear pre_metrics.csv for psilo-themed hybrid renewal.\ncontent: |\n  import subprocess\n\n  subprocess.call([\n      'python',\n      'storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_boundary.py',\n      '--input_csv', 'storage/shared/atlas/edges/aether/renewal_hybrid_psilo/pre_metrics.csv',\n      '--entry_json', 'storage/shared/atlas/edges/aether/renewal_hybrid_psilo/entry.json',\n      '--out_dir', 'storage/shared/atlas/edges/aether/renewal_hybrid_psilo/pre'\n  ])\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Post-Boundary Run for Hybrid Psilo Renewal\ntags: renewal, hybrid, psilocybin, monotonicity\nabstract: Running run_boundary.py on sinusoidal post_metrics.csv to explore monotonicity edges.\ncontent: |\n  import subprocess\n\n  subprocess.call([\n\
