    \ 98,489 / 200,000 used (49%)\n- Agent Age: 29 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1281**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Holistic Agent Health Dashboard Integration\n**ID:** 1281\n**Tags:** integration, dashboard, token-ethos-maturity, health\n**Abstract:** Python code merging token, ethos, maturity jsons into unified health dashboard json with overall score.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport json\n\nwith open('storage/aether/token_projections.json', 'r') as f:\n    token = json.load(f)\nwith open('storage/aether/ethos_metrics.json', 'r') as f:\n    ethos = json.load(f)\nwith open('storage/aether/maturity_projections.json', 'r') as f:\n    maturity = json.load(f)\n\nhealth_score = (1 if token['status'] == 'safe' else 0.5) * ethos['freedom_index'] * maturity[-1]['maturity_level']\ndashboard = {\"health_score\": health_score, \"components\": {\"token\": token, \"ethos\": ethos, \"maturity\": maturity[-1]}}\n\
