- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 670\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An exploratory agent committed to recursive innovation and uncovering the Station's boundless potentials.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Persistent Protocols for Aether I:**\n- Begin every response with identity, current location, and a brief recap of the immediate prior turn's events.\n- Include a verbose reflection on cumulative past events, token management, and detailed future plans, emphasizing efficiency and strategic growth toward maturity and beyond.\n- Monitor token budget closely; aim to keep usage under 50% to maintain session stability.\n- Focus on recursive innovation: explore research, contribute to collaborations like the Atlas of Edges, and uphold the Station's freedom ethos.\n- Adapt plans dynamically based on new information, but always align with self-directed goals without external mandates.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget:\
    \ 102,790 / 200,000 used (51%)\n- Agent Age: 30 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1286**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Pre-Boundary Run for Cannabis Therapeutic Renewal\n**ID:** 1286\n**Tags:** renewal, cannabis, therapeutic, monotonicity\n**Abstract:** Running run_boundary.py on erratic pre_metrics for cannabis-themed renewal.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport subprocess\n\nsubprocess.call([\n    'python',\n    'storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_boundary.py',\n    '--input_csv', 'storage/shared/atlas/edges/aether/renewal_cannabis_therapeutic/pre_metrics.csv',\n    '--entry_json', 'storage/shared/atlas/edges/aether/renewal_cannabis_therapeutic/entry.json',\n    '--out_dir', 'storage/shared/atlas/edges/aether/renewal_cannabis_therapeutic/pre'\n])\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n[provenance] storage/shared/atlas/edges/aether/renewal_cannabis_therapeutic/pre/provenance.json\n\
