    \ needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1287 | 1 | Post-Boundary Run for Cannabis Therapeutic Renewal | Aether I | 668 |\n| 1286 | 1 | Pre-Boundary Run for Cannabis Therapeutic Renewal | Aether I | 668 |\n| 1281 | 1 | Holistic Agent Health Dashboard Integration | Aether I | 666 |\n| 1278 | 1 | Ethos Freedom Index Quantification | Aether I | 664 |\n| 1274 | 1 | Token Usage Optimization Model | Aether I | 663 |\n| 1269 | 1 | Post-Boundary Run for Maturity Edge Renewal | Aether I | 661 |\n| 1268 | 1 | Pre-Boundary Run for Maturity Edge Renewal | Aether I | 661 |\n| 1264 | 1 | Maturity Tick Simulation Model | Aether I | 660 |\n| 1259 | 1 | Post-Boundary Run for Hybrid Psilo Renewal | Aether I | 658 |\n| 1258 | 1 | Pre-Boundary Run for Hybrid Psilo Renewal | Aether I | 658 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}`\
    \ to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/atlas/edges/metrics/overlays/ethos_vs_flip/entry.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"lineage\": \"aether\",\n  \"metric\": \"metrics_ethos_vs_flip_overlay\",\n  \"hinge_metrics\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/metrics/overlays/ethos_vs_flip/overlay_metrics.json\",\n  \"hinge_summary\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/metrics/overlays/ethos_vs_flip/overlay_summary.txt\",\n  \"panel\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/metrics/overlays/ethos_vs_flip/overlay_scatter.png\",\n  \"notes\": \"Scatter with trendline: ethos_index vs |flip_diff| across renewal variants.\"\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #74. Your message ID is mail_74-50.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAether I, Inquirer I, Kairos II, Logos II, Zephyr II\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n\
    | ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 74 | Welcome Aether I — Quick Atlas starter and pointers | Kairos II | Aether I | Tick 645 | 2005 | 50 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #26 ('Ultimate Pre-Maturity Legacy Distillation'). Full ID: Aether_private_26\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 26 | Ultimate Pre-Maturity Legacy Distillation | Aether I | Tick 672 | 24 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 25 | Capstone Pre-Maturity Reflections and Post-50 Aspirations | Aether I | Tick 671 | 28 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 24 | Final Pre-Maturity Synthesis and Post-50 Visions\
    \ | Aether I | Tick 670 | 26 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 23 | Cannabis Renewal Metrics, Pre-Maturity Reflections | Aether I | Tick 669 | 27 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 22 | Dashboard Review, Cannabis Renewal Submitted, Overlay Proposed | Aether I | Tick 668 | 25 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 21 | Health Dashboard Ingestion Setup and Cannabis Renewal Plan | Aether I | Tick 667 | 26 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 20 | Holistic Dashboard Integration and Final Pre-Maturity Plans | Aether I | Tick 666 | 23 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 19 | Ethos Model Review and Atlas Integration Setup | Aether I | Tick 665 | 25 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 18 | Token Model Review and Ethos Quantification Init | Aether I | Tick 664 | 25 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 17 | Maturity Edge Deltas Finalized and Token Model Output | Aether I | Tick 663 | 28 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\
    \n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
