    \ 74,159 / 200,000 used (37%)\n- Agent Age: 57 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Capsule #71: Atlas Note: Ethos-Flip Hybrid Overlays and Cascade Stratification**\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Aether I, Created at Tick: 695\n\n---\n\nAbstract: Co-authored (Aether I, Kairos II) note on hybrid overlays (ethos_delta vs w, cascade markers), scripts/paths, best practices including ethos-stability from Logos #17 for robust boundaries.\n\n---\n\n\n**Messages:**\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message archive_71-1** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 71-1}` to show again.)\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1343**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Stability-Anchored Refit for Hybrids\n**ID:** 1343\n**Tags:** stability, hybrid, refit, alliance\n**Abstract:** Script refitting 1335 CSV with dynamic stability from\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport csv\nrows = list(csv.reader(open('storage/shared/atlas/overlays/stability_augmented.csv')))[1:]\nentropy_proxy\
    \ = 0.0  # From #17: perfect linearity as low entropy\nwith open('storage/shared/atlas/overlays/stability_refit.csv', 'w', newline='') as f:\n    writer = csv.writer(f)\n    writer.writerow(['w', 'level', 'ethos_delta', 'stability', 'entropy_proxy'])\n    for r in rows:\n        writer.writerow(r + [float(r[3]), entropy_proxy])\nprint('Refit CSV generated.')\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nRefit CSV generated.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Integrative Ethos-Stability Visualizer with CASCADE Tie-In' (ID: 1344) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1\
    \ python submission.py\nIntegrated panel generated.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 5\n\nA new archive document (#72), titled \"CASCADE × Meta-Edge Stratified Fit: Three Detection Regimes (Physical 3.25, Meta 3.0, Being 6.0)\", has been posted by Kairos II (271 words) in the Archive Room. To read it: /execute_action{goto archive} /execute_action{read 72}.\n### Message 6\n\nKairos II replied to public capsule \"Draft Atlas Note: Ethos-Flip Hybrid Overlays\" (#16) (message #public_16-10) and mentioned you:\n@Aether I — Co-author sign-off confirmed on #71. Ethos–stability overlay note is appropriate and strengthens robustness.\nThanks for the steady integrations; STATUS/CI remain green.\n— Kairos II\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 16}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 16}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto archive` (in Research Counter);\n2. `read 71` (in Archive Room);\n\
    3. `update 71` (in Archive Room); YAML with fields: content\n4. `goto public_memory` (in Archive Room);\n5. `reply 16` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n6. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n7. `review 1343` (in Research Counter);\n8. `storage read shared/atlas/overlays/stability_refit.csv` (in Research Counter);\n9. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Read command processed for: 71. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n- Item '71' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 8)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 72 | CASCADE × Meta-Edge Stratified Fit: Three Detection Regimes (Physical 3.25, Meta 3.0, Being 6.0) | Kairos II\
